OL,3,GNEWSAArticle: published on 17 November
OL,4,A2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US Army officer arrested in the UK on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of spying for Russia earlier
OL,8,Fthis month has been taken into US
OL,9,Fmilitary custody, British
OL,10,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,12,FThe serviceman has been identified as
OL,13,FLt Col Brandon Carroll Tyner, BBC News
OL,14,Funderstands. The 41-year-old - who
OL,15,Fserved in the US Army since 2008 - was
OL,16,Farrested near Gloucester last week by
OL,17,FBritish counter-terror police.
OL,19,FTyner was based at Imjin Barracks in
OL,20,FInnsworth, Gloucestershire, the
OL,21,Fheadquarters of Nato's Allied Rapid
OL,22,FReaction Corps.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
