OL,5,
OL,6,FCounter Terrorism Policing said he is
OL,7,Fnow in US custody over suspected
OL,8,Fnational security and espionage
OL,9,Fallegations. At the time of his arrest,
OL,10,FRussia said it had "nothing to do with
OL,11,Fit".
